WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:01.418
Are you Marty?

00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:03.212
-Yeah.
-What brings you here?

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:04.546
I don't know. 

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.632
Phyllis made me come.
My sister.

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:08.675
She must be very persuasive.

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.012
So, tell me about yourself.

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:14.932
I run a fabrics company.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.350
So you're the boss, that feel good?

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.267
It feels...

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:21.063
Phyllis has always been the strong one.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.857
You are a grown man
hiding behind a wall of curtains.

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.359
I think I can help you.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.486
First thing I'm gonna do is
completely unethical.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.987
I'm gonna give you a hug.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.656
I'm a hugger.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.869
There's no shame
in feeling pain, Marty.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:37.704
You're the ruler of your own domain.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.458
Work begins at 9 a.m., sharp.

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:43.752
Phyllis!

00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:45.629
I'm trying to be ruler of my own domain.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.965
This therapy is really working out, huh?

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.591
It is, it really is.

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:53.804
The goal of life is to live.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.391
So we'll turn you into
the man you truly deserve to be.

00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:00.185
This doctor is a little... unconventional.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.603
He's a miracle worker.

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.980
What is he doing here?

00:01:03.856 --> 00:01:05.482
Helping us, what do you think?

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:07.860
-So much fun.
-Is that allowed?

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:09.361
Well I did the work, didn't I?

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.697
He's changed my life.

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:15.117
He's changed me.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.202
You clearly have a good eye.

00:01:17.286 --> 00:01:19.329
-Me?
-You're the one with the good eye.

00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:21.373
Eyes.  Two eyes.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.960
The, the...appropriate quota of
ocular spheres.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.754
-Why are we running?
-I don't know. Run!

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:29.339
You are growing, Marty!

00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:32.926
Is he your psychiatrist?

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:35.971
Psychiatrist, business partner,
best friend.

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:36.972
How does all that work?

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:40.601
He just has no boundaries
and I don't trust him.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.269
Cut her out of your life.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.521
She's the only family I have.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:48.901
Without trust, we have nothing.

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:50.068
I trust you completely.

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:55.616
-This is my decision.
-He's living in your head.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:59.870
I... am going to take care...
of everything.

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:05.542
Feels good, doesn't it?

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:07.753
Yeah.

